; A parenthesis that opens no number expression is a token of its own to
; beancount's lexer, and what follows it is lexed as usual. The string in
; parentheses on line 6 ends on its line, so the open on line 7 is read,
; and the open on line 11 is its duplicate. The same holds for the note on
; line 9 and the option after it.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-02 * "a string in parentheses" ("a")
2020-01-03 open Assets:B

2020-01-04 note Assets:A (")"A
option "title" "kept"
2020-01-05 open Assets:B
